# Add-Sub

A Verilog implementation of the HDLBits **Module addsub** exercise.

## Overview

The circuit performs addition or subtraction on two 32-bit inputs. The `sub` control signal selects the operation.

## Implementation

The design uses two 16-bit adder modules to produce the 32-bit result. When subtraction is selected, the second input is inverted and the carry-in is set, implementing two’s-complement subtraction.

